---
import SourceBadge from '../ui/SourceBadge.astro';
---

<section class="py-24 bg-slate-900 text-white overflow-hidden relative">
  <!-- Decorative background elements -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-500 rounded-full blur-[128px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-500 rounded-full blur-[128px]"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      
      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div class="animate-fade-up">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6 text-white">
          Nutrition data should show its source.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Food Nutrition Calculator is planned around a transparent nutrition hierarchy. You deserve to know exactly where your meal calculations come from.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-brand-400 mr-3 mt-1 text-sm font-bold">1</span>
            <span class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white font-medium">USDA FoodData Central first:</strong> We prioritize verified data from the gold standard of US nutrition.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-brand-400 mr-3 mt-1 text-sm font-bold">2</span>
            <span class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white font-medium">Local database fallback second:</strong> For common foods that might not match perfectly with scientific descriptions.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-slate-800 text-brand-400 mr-3 mt-1 text-sm font-bold">3</span>
            <span class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed"><strong class="text-white font-medium">LLM estimate last:</strong> Future AI features will parse messy meal descriptions, but estimates will always be clearly labeled and never masquerade as verified data.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual Content -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800/50 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl animate-fade-up" style="animation-delay: 200ms;">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">Transparent Source Badges</h3>
        
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-slate-900/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
            <div>
              <div class="font-medium text-white mb-1">Raw Broccoli</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">1 cup chopped</div>
            </div>
            <SourceBadge source="USDA" />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-slate-900/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
            <div>
              <div class="font-medium text-white mb-1">Generic Granola Bar</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">1 bar (40g)</div>
            </div>
            <SourceBadge source="Local" />
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-slate-900/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-700">
            <div>
              <div class="font-medium text-white mb-1">Mom's Meatloaf</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-slate-400">1 slice</div>
            </div>
            <SourceBadge source="Estimate" />
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-slate-700 text-sm text-slate-400 flex items-start">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2 text-brand-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          Every food item should eventually show a source badge. You'll never have to guess where the numbers came from.
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
